{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践：把分布接回现实","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sampling-inference","title":"采样与推断：从一个分布里取出可用的答案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/practice/sampling-inference","wordCount":1615,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"mdn-applications","title":"应用：从逆运动学到轨迹预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/practice/mdn-applications","wordCount":1738,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"mdn-in-practice","title":"落地与边界：选几个分量，什么时候别用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mixture-density-networks/practice/mdn-in-practice","wordCount":1676,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实践-把分布接回现实\">实践：把分布接回现实</h1><p>训练收敛之后，你手上是一个能对任意输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 吐出条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的网络。可下游系统——机械臂、导航栈、语音合成器——往往要的是具体动作或波形。这一章讲怎么把一个分布变成可用的输出，看真实项目怎么用 MDN，以及在什么时候该换别的工具。</p>\n<p><a href=\"sampling-inference\">采样与推断</a> 讲取用之道。从混合分布采样是两步：先按混合系数抽一个分量，再从那个高斯里采一个点。这篇还辨析了均值、众数、条件众数这几种点估计的区别——直接对多峰分布取均值，恰恰会犯回基础章 <a href=\"../foundations/multimodal-regression\">多峰回归之痛</a> 里那个&quot;平均出错误答案&quot;的老毛病。</p>\n<p><a href=\"mdn-applications\">应用</a> 摆事实。逆运动学与逆问题是 MDN 的经典主场；Alex Graves 的手写生成、语音合成里的声学模型、自动驾驶与行人轨迹预测、强化学习里的世界模型（如 MDN-RNN），都靠 MDN 表达&quot;未来有好几种可能&quot;。2025 年前后还出现了扩散增强的双 MDN 轨迹预测等新变体，这篇给出应用地图与选型线索。</p>\n<p><a href=\"mdn-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 划界限。它谈实操问题——分量数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 怎么定、拿什么指标评估分布质量、代码上常见的坑——更重要的是划清 MDN 的适用边界：什么时候它够用，什么时候该让位给 <a href=\"../normalizing-flows/\">归一化流</a>、扩散模型，或形状无关的 <a href=\"../quantile-regression-methods/practice/prediction-intervals\">分位数回归</a>。</p>\n<p>本章之于全 hub，是从&quot;模型能训了&quot;走到&quot;系统能上线了&quot;这最后一公里。前三章教你造出并驯服一个 MDN，这一章教你把它放进真实管线，并诚实地知道它的天花板在哪。</p>\n"}